Just got Nethack 3.1.3, and like other versions of nethack, you can still 
cheat. :)

Pets are quite useful, or so I've found... :)  I have two grey dragons as 
pets, one which is a 22nd level and one which is a baby grey dragon at 
level 14.  :)  The things can take more abuse than my wimpy 13th level 
barbarian. 

The barbarian is named Dossy, the mature grey dragon is Lassie, and the 
baby is Benji.  :)

(So named because they were both originally dogs)

Makes the game so much nicer--especially when fighting things that rot 
armor and weapons like puddings and rust monstesr--hide behind the two 
dragons and let things get slaughtered. :)

Just wanted to share this with the world... mainly because I wanted to 
ask one question:  what is the most powerful monster?  I figure the grey 
dragons are pretty nasty, and I haven't found much that's nastier that I 
can make into pets.  I've considered elementals, etc, but even my dinky 
barbarian can run over elementals and golems without thinking twice, but 
a dragon (or a red naga, ouch) are forces to be reckoned with.  Maybe 
next time I get a pet I'll make it a red naga... hm.  (the fire is 
dangerous though).

If anyone can answer my question...
